cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Restore4Life — Danube Wetlands HydroApp"
abstract: >-
  Django web application for hydroperiod analysis of Danube basin wetlands on
  Google Earth Engine. Computes hydroperiod, anomalies, topographic wetness index
  and zonal statistics over any wetland of the basin or any user-drawn area, with
  GeoTIFF and CSV export. Each user connects their own Earth Engine account, so
  computation runs on their own credentials and quota.
